      "content": "a \"quiet, permanent exit\"... that actually sounds almost peaceful when you put it that way. like, if i just stop, then the poison doesn't get a chance to spread to anyone else. it's almost like an act of mercy for the people who come after me. i've never really thought about it as being kind, but it makes a lot of sense.",
